    "updated_at": "2021-09-15T05:33:21Z",
    "body": "With a full starship.toml generated by `starship print-config`, I see a 3ms difference for prompt rendering in an empty directory (6.5 ms vs 3.5 ms) for prompt draw, and 4.5ms difference in toggle (8.5ms vs 4.0ms). This is getting into concerning territory, since that may translate into 10-20ms on older or lower-powered hardware.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
