    "body": "New benchmarks with toml-edit 0.5:\r\n\r\nPrompt in empty directory with full config:\r\n| Command | Mean [ms] | Min [ms] | Max [ms] | Relative |\r\n|:---|---:|---:|---:|---:|\r\n| `toml` | 4.8 ± 0.3 | 4.4 | 5.8 | 1.00 |\r\n| `toml-edit` | 5.4 ± 0.3 | 5.1 | 6.5 | 1.13 ± 0.08 |\r\n\r\n`starship toggle scala` with full config (but this would need to be rewritten to take advantage of the format-preserving non-easy API):\r\n| Command | Mean [ms] | Min [ms] | Max [ms] | Relative |\r\n|:---|---:|---:|---:|---:|\r\n| `toml` | 4.2 ± 0.3 | 3.8 | 5.2 | 1.00 |\r\n| `toml-edit` | 4.7 ± 0.2 | 4.4 | 5.3 | 1.12 ± 0.09 |",
